export anchor CosyLinenStyle:
    number: 380
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Cosy linen
    idea: The home dressed like a warm den at night, dark walnut wood behind stitched linen cards, serif headings, a hanging fabric tag for the alert and an energy chart sewn in running stitches.
    base: dark
    palette:
        wood: #1d140e, walnut page with a faint grain
        shelf: #2f1f14, the header shelf and sheet top edge
        linen: #2a231d, card cloth with a 4px weave
        linen2: #332a22, patches, scene tabs, secondary buttons
        stitch: #7a6650, dashed stitched borders and the chart baseline
        ink: #f1e6d6, text
        mute: #c6b49e, meta and labels
        terra: #eb9a72, the alert tag, motion and the primary button
        onTerra: #2a1206, text on terra
        mustard: #ebc672, lights on, active scene, peak stitches and focus
        sage: #b3cfa3, locked and battery yarn
        rose: #e8a7a0, heating schedule
    type:
        Serif headings and figures, Charter, Bitstream Charter, Sitka Text,
        Cambria, Georgia. Humanist sans text, Seravek, Gill Sans Nova, Gill
        Sans, Trebuchet MS, Ubuntu, base 16px at 1.55. Title 26px with an
        italic mustard Home, card titles 22px, room temperatures 30px,
        energy figures 34px, state labels 14px at 600.
    layout:
        A dark walnut page with a faint vertical wood grain. A wooden shelf
        bar across the top holds Brightwork Home with an italic mustard Home
        and Saturday evening. Under it a hanging fabric tag cut to a point
        on the left, with a punched hole, carries the garage alert in terra
        on deep rust and a terra Close now. A 12 column grid follows. The
        left 7 columns hold linen room cards two across, the living room
        spanning both, each with a woven texture, a dashed stitch line inset
        7px, a round stitched patch with the room icon, a serif name and
        temperature, and a small dark label with a state icon and word
        beside a muted line. The right 5 columns stack Energy today with
        serif figures, a striped sage yarn battery bar and a bar chart sewn
        in vertical running stitches, mustard for hours over 1 kWh, then
        Scenes as fabric tabs with a round sewn button that fills mustard
        with a check and the words On now for Movie. Below 1000px the right
        column moves under the rooms in two columns, and at phone width
        everything stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between cards, 22 to 24px card padding.
    density: Medium low. Five room cards, energy and scenes.
    corners: 10px cards, 8px buttons and tabs, round patches and scene buttons, and a pointed tag for the alert.
    borders: A 1.5px dashed stitch line in #7a6650 inset inside every card, and a solid stitch colour on buttons.
    shadows:
        A 2px dark ledge plus 0 10px 20px black at 40 percent, like cloth on
        a table. The shelf casts 0 6px 12px.
    icons:
        Rounded 1.7 stroke icons at 20px in stitched round patches. States
        pair a word with a bulb, dash circle, clock, lock or walker.
    focus: A 3px mustard outline offset 3px.
    tone: Homely and spoken, such as Saturday evening, Open for 2 hours now and Seen at half past nine.
